    "text": "package Decimal_Fixed_Point_Type_Error is\n\n   type Decimal_Error_1 is\n     delta 2.0 ** (-1) digits 3;\n   --      ^^^^^^^^^^^\n   --  ERROR: not power of ten\n\n   type Decimal_Error_2 is\n     delta 0.125 digits 3;\n   --      ^^^^^\n   --  ERROR: not power of ten\n\nend Decimal_Fixed_Point_Type_Error;\n",
